ments reached 612.39 GWh in 2025, representing a 94.59% year-on-year (YoY) increase. In terms of market segments, the utility-scale cell market reached an annual shipment volume of 556.74 GWh, up 96.73% YoY. Against this backdrop, HiTHIUM's Top 2 ranking on both leaderboards further highlights its cutting-edge technical strength and dominance within the mainstream market.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nVOO shares owned by AdvisorNet Financial - Historical positions on stockzoa.com (https://stockzoa.com/ticker/voo/ownership/advisornet-financial-inc/)\nciteturn110search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: last month; \n\n# Vanguard S&p 500 Etf idx shares owned by AdvisorNet Financial\n\nQuarter-by-quarter ownership of Vanguard S&p 500 Etf idx (VOO) shares owned by AdvisorNet Financial from 13F filings\n\n### Historical chart of AdvisorNet Financial investment in Vanguard S&p 500 Etf idx\n\n#### Tip: Access up to 7 years of quarterly data\n\nAll positions including Vanguard S&p 500 Etf idx held by AdvisorNet Financial consolidated in one spreadsheet with up to 7 years of data\n\nDownload as csv Download as Excel\n\n### Quarterly reported holdings in Vanguard S&p 500 Etf idx by AdvisorNet Financial\n\nQuarter filed  | Position value  | Share count  | Share price at filing\n--- | --- | --- | ---\n2026-06-30  | $22M  | 32k  | 686.81\n2026-03-31  | $19M  | 31k  | 597.55\n2025-12-31  | $17M  | 27k  | 627.12\n2025-09-30  | $16M  | 27k  | 612.39\n2025-06-30  | $12M  | 22k  | 568.03\n2025-03-31  | $11M  | 21k  | 513.91\n2024-12-31  | $9.8M  | 18k  | 538.80\n2024-09-30  | $8.5M  | 16k  | 527.66\n2024-06-30  | $7.5M  | 15k  | 500.14\n2024-03-31  | $6.9M  | 14k  | 480.69\n2023-12-31  | $20M  | 47k  | 436.80\n2023-09-30  | $17M  | 43k  | 392.71\n2023-06-30  | $17M  | 41k  | 407.27\n2023-03-31  | $15M  | 40k  | 376.07\n2022-12-31  | $14M  | 40k  | 351.34\n2022-09-30  | $13M  | 39k  | 328.29\n2022-06-30  | $14M  | 40k  | 346.87\n2022-03-31